     Cell[BoxData[
     "SmartMask"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "2f9edfb3-d784-ed44-a09c-0be08c5c03f1"],
     ". This specifies how the mask is generated. Can be \"Continuous\" or \
\"Catagorical\"."
